`a week of four days has no gross-up threshold, edition 8` MEANS
    `the gross-up threshold, edition 7` (`a four-day week, edition 7`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `a week of four days has no gross-up threshold, edition 8`

`why 2.7 gives no gross-up threshold for another week, edition 8` MEANS
